/********************************************************************/
/* The remaining instructions are the bound program built-ins,      */
/* which the reference documents as a call returning a value        */
/* rather than as a statement, so they are named here but not       */
/* written as statements:                                           */
/*   ACOS       ADDR       ANDCSTR    ANDSTR     ASIN       ATAN      */
/*   ATANH      ATMCADD    ATMCAND    ATMCOR     BITPERM    CALLPGMV  */
/*   CHKLKVAL   CLRINVF    CLRLKVAL   CMPSWP     CMPTOPAD   CNT       */
/*   CNTLZ4     CNTLZ8     COMSTR     COS        COSH       COT       */
/*   CPYBO      CPYBYTES   DCL        DEQWAIT    DIVREM     EDITPD    */
/*   EEXP       ENTRY      EXT        FINDBYTE   INITEHCA   INVP      */
/*   LBCPYNV    LBCPYNVR   LBEDIT     LIST       LN         LOCKTSL   */
/*   MATACTEX   MATMATR1   MATMIF     MATMTX     MATOBJLCK  MATPGMNM  */
/*   MATPRMTX   MATQMSGQ   MATTODAT   MEMCHR     MEMCMP     MEMCPY    */
/*   MEMMOVE    MEMUSEHINT  MODS1      MODS2      MPYADD     MPYSUB    */
/*   MVLICOPT   NPM        OPM        ORSTR      PARM       PARMLIST  */
/*   PCOPTR     PCOPTR2    PEND       POPCNT4    POPCNT8    POPCNTB   */
/*   POPPAR4    POPPAR8    POWER      PROPB      QUANTIZEBE  QUANTIZEBV */
/*   RETCA      RETINVF    RETTHCNT   RETTHID    RETTSADR   SCANX     */
/*   SETCA      SETINVF    SIN        SINH       STRCHRNULL  STRCMPNULL */
/*   STRCPYNULL  STRLENNULL  STRNCMPNULL  STRNCPYNULL  STRNCPYNULLPAD  SYNCADDF  */
/*   SYNCANDF   SYNCBCMPSW  SYNCCLR    SYNCCMPSW  SYNCFADD   SYNCFAND  */
/*   SYNCFNAND  SYNCFOR    SYNCFSUB   SYNCFXOR   SYNCNANDF  SYNCORF   */
/*   SYNCSTG    SYNCSTO    SYNCSUBF   SYNCXORF   TAN        TANH      */
/*   TESTINTR   TESTPDC    TESTPTR    TESTRPL    TESTSUBSET  TSTINLTH  */
/*   UNLCKTSL   XLATEB     XLATEB1    XORSTR                        */
